{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The source distinguishes backend read errors from missing keys, but the batch-merging path treats both as absence. I’ll check whether a cold-cache append can report success while discarding the stored prefix. The check will allow the append to return an error; it will require prefix preservation only if the append succeeds.\n"}}
